    {
      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_622c28ebc7543980a77d4e03e6c3e2bb70c8632949c6ff167cd65f88926856c3",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The formal repulsive gradient-flow picture is made rigorous by changing the quantity being evolved. Gaps are normalized against the slowly varying classical locations, convex pair defects subtract the divergent reference background, smooth weights and a nearby-pair cutoff localize the infinite system, approximate dissipation links the renormalized Hamiltonian to renormalized energy, and coercivity plus level-set descent forces finite-time relaxation in the integrated-energy sense.",
